{% comment %}
	=== FUNCTIONALITY ===

	- Renders outline, solid, and review pills from the Figma component library.


	=== PARAMETERS ===

	- "label" is the pill text.
	- "style" selects outline, solid, or review.
	- "rating" is the review value for the review treatment.


	Section Author: rishi@subjectmatter.studio
{% endcomment %}

{% assign pill_style = style | default: 'outline' %}
<span class="foulplay-pill foulplay-pill--{{ pill_style }}">
	{% if pill_style == 'review' -%}
		<span class="foulplay-pill__star" aria-hidden="true">★</span>
	{%- endif %}
	{{ rating | default: label | escape }}
</span>
